'''Thunderblood Spear''' is a version of [[Nord Spear]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[pierce]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

An upgraded Nord Spear will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Spear.

